Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不必害怕黑暗中流行的瘟疫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor for the pestilence that walketh in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是在正午把人毁灭的毒病{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor for the destruction that wasteth at noonday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿主与我同在  在我需要之时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be with me Lord, in my hour of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华是我的避难所{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because thou hast made the Lord, which is my refuge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已将至高者当你的居所{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even the most high, thy habitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.77,0:01:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿主与我同在  在我需要之时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be with me Lord, in my hour of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.01,0:01:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祸患必不临到你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There shall no evil befall thee,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.57,0:01:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灾害也不挨近你的帐棚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}neither shall any plague come nigh thy dwelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿主与我同在  在我需要之时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be with me Lord, in my hour of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:27.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因他要为你吩咐他的使者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For he shall give his angels charge over thee,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你行的一切道路上保护你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep thee in all thy ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿主与我同在  在我需要之时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be with me Lord, in my hour of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们休息一下吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take a little break, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  你还好吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon, are you feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.63,0:01:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.26,0:01:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都记不清上次这种情况是什么时候的事了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't remember one quite like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该去睡一会儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should try and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:05.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带他去吧  格拉策尔先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'll take him, Mr. Glatzel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.07,0:02:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-谢谢你  阿尔尼  -没事  来  小家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Arne. - No problem. Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他受不了继续这样下去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't take much more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不用继续这样了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驱魔已经获得批准  接下来进展会很快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things will move quickly now that the exorcism's been approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戈登神父已经在来的路上了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Gordon's already on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.69,0:02:35.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是一个很勇敢的孩子  你知道吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one brave kid, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候个子比较矮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a little runt growing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我知道经常被欺负的滋味{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I know what it's like to be picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这和你现在的遭遇比起来根本不算什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was nothing compared to what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不觉得自己很勇敢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't feel very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇敢并不代表不害怕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being brave doesn't mean you're not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是说明你虽然害怕  但仍然坚持住了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means you are scared but you hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让你出任何事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.
