Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.18,0:03:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-少来  -真的  我...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - No, I don't, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  不  不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-戴维  -戴维  他在哪里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- David! - David! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了什么  孩子  你没事吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening, buddy? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:37.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父  我们得赶紧开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, we need to do this, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  把他抱上车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's get him down to the car
