Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊  求你拯救这倚靠你的仆人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your servant who trusts in you, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主啊  在他周围{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him find in you, Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筑起抵御敌人的堡垒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a fortified tower in the face of the enemy.
