Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿主从圣所救助他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord! Send him aid from your Holy place
