Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点  艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  艾德  快点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed. Ed, Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有用{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  戴维  等等{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? David, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下  怎么回事  怎么回事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  戴维  帮帮我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David! David! Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么  戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? David!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救他  求你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him, please!
