Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说  别缠着他  他只是个小男孩  懦夫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, leave him alone. He's just a little boy, you coward!
