Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你的心停止跳动  老家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stop your heart, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  看着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我  我知道你还在  戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. I know you're still in there, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别缠着他了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave him alone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别缠着他  冲我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone and take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲我来  冲我来啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, take me. Take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动他  来找我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone and take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  戴维  戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David. David, David!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  你没事吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  来妈妈这{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, go with Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  艾德  亲爱的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed? Ed! Hon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-赶紧打急救电话  -好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Somebody call 911! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对八岁男孩戴维·格拉策尔的驱魔仪式原本是要结束他几个月来遭受的折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是对于阿尔尼·约翰逊来说  一切才刚刚开始  接下来发生的一系列惨剧轰动了全美国
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对八岁男孩戴维· 也导致了沃伦夫妇职业生涯中最邪恶的发现
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:11:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,《招魂3：鬼使神差》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃伦太太{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的情况稳定了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把他转移到心内科病房{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna transfer him to the coronary unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-所以他是心脏病发吗  -是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, it was a heart attack? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且恐怕还挺严重{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not a minor one, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们现在能看看他吗  -还不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we see him now? - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在他的动脉里植入支架{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna to put a stent into his artery,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽力帮助他血液流回心脏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try to get blood flowing back to his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他会没事吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, is he gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得先做一些测试{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need to run a few more tests
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才能给你们肯定的答复{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before I'm comfortable answering that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-别缠着他  -阿尔尼  别和它对话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave him alone! - Arne, don't talk to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别缠着他  冲我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone and take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别缠着他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木乃伊终于活了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, the mummy lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么让我睡到现在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, why did you let me sleep so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我让你睡的  我根本叫不醒你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't let you, I couldn't wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:22.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你叫不醒我  -是啊  叫不醒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You couldn't wake me? - No, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可真奇怪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定不够努力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mustn't have been trying very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-冷静点  冷静点  -布鲁诺就在外面呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Buddy! Easy, easy, easy! - Okay, Bruno is right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  布鲁诺见得多了  他才不介意{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on. Bruno's a worldly man, he doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  等等  我其实真有话要问你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, wait. Actually, I do want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你想问什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. What do you want to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是什么大事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...我一直在想{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've... I've been thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在戴维也没事了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now David's out of the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们应该把这一切抛到脑后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe we should put all this behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.20,0:12:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这个地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.44,0:13:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么样  -你是指离开布鲁克菲尔德吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know? - You mean, leave Brookfield?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  为什么不呢  这里没什么好留恋的了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, why not? We've got nothing keeping us here now. Do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  只除了我的家人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Nothing but my family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我们没有钱  阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the money we don't have. Arne--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  钱不是什么大问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, well, money's no big deal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都有工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both working,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方又不需要我们花钱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this place doesn't cost us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  我才刚开始这份工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, I just started this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能就这么一走了之{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't just up and walk out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-老天啊  -再说了 布鲁诺根本不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus Christ! - And besides, Bruno doesn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么照顾这些狗狗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the first thing about taking care of these dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我好好考虑一下  好吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me think about it. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你会考虑吗  -嗯  我会考虑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll think about it? - Yeah, I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  换衣服吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.34,0:13:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得戴维肯定会喜欢的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think David will love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你联系我妈妈了吗  -是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you call my mom? - Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我和她说了我们会迟到  -好的  谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told her we were going to be very late. - Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  阿尔尼  别吃了  别吃了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Arne. Please stop eating, please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈斯基特太太  见到你很高兴  谢谢你过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Haskett, so good to see you, thanks for coming by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:13:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们要出去了  -再见  波奇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, we're headed out now. - Bye, Pookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我写下了在我们离开期间你要做的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote down a list of stuff for you to do while we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安排这些工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, keeping track of this stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我花钱雇你做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is what I'm supposed to be paying you for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周末可不算{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not on weekends, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都让你免费住在这里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm letting you live here rent free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该能包含周末了  也许还能包含节假日{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should buy me the weekends maybe the holidays, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  安迪一杯  其他狗狗两杯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Andy gets one cup, everyone else gets two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔魔和火花会被接走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic and Sparky are getting picked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不用担心它们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you don't need to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过今天下午你还得找个时间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you'll have to take everyone else outside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有狗都遛了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at some point this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露比对蜜蜂过敏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruby's allergic to bees,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:22.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一它被蜜蜂蛰了  你得打给急救兽医{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if she gets stung you've got to call the emergency vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把号码写下来贴在冰箱上了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wrote the number down and stuck it on the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  想轻松赚五块钱吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, you wanna make a quick five bucks, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的音响坏了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My stereo's busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  我晚点看看  不过得收十五块{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure. I'll take a look at it later. But, make it 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十块{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-今早真是...  -我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...what happened this morning. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  好了  请别说出去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ma, okay. Please don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说的  我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't say anything, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  就是...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他问我能不能和他一起离开布鲁克菲尔德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked if we could leave Brookfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你懂他是什么意思吧  -不懂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what that means, don't you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你是说他向你求婚了  -不算是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Actually, you mean he proposed? - Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你答应他了吗  -还没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you say, yes? - Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  你能把盛着肉的盘子端出来吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne! Can you bring out the tray with the meat on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  我都饿死了  你饿不饿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. I'm starving! Are you starving, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我去拿肉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'll go get the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:08.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(布鲁克菲尔德综合医院  急诊室)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅里克医生  请到六号手术室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Merrick, to OR-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梅里克医生  请到六号手术室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Merrick, to OR-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴能再见到朱迪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nice seeing Judy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会待很久吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will she be staying long?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  要看情况...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, um, it depends if...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护士说你这几天都在这椅子上睡觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nurse says that you have been sleeping in that chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回家休息一会  艾德会理解的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed would understand if you went home for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有没有跟你讲过我们是怎么认识的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I ever tell you the story of how we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.81,0:17:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.48,0:17:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只说了是高中时期的青春情愫  对吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just that you were young. In high school, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.10,0:18:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  那时我们十七岁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We were 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(白杨电影院)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和闺蜜们出去玩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went out with my girlfriends and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.47,0:18:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看电影  他是电影院的引座员{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he was an usher at the movie theater that we went to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看完电影后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afterwards...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出去吃冰淇淋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we went out for ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带我去公园  没想到下起了雨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took me out to the park, but then it started to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们站在凉亭下躲雨  直到雨停{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we stood under the gazebo until it stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转眼三十年过去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以回我们的房子去  神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could go back to the house, Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.33,0:18:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他在哪  家就在哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my home is here with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  阿尔尼  你在搞什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, Arne! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.78,0:20:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能让它们消停消停{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we please do something about this racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些狗吠得我要发疯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These dogs are driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们可能闻到兔子或什么的了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probably just smell a rabbit or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你怎么没上班  -我有点不舒服{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How come you're not at work? - I wasn't feeling so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  你来得正是时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne! Perfect timing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来陪我喝杯啤酒吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come inside with me, have a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.37,0:20:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能把音响修好  就能挂牌关门休息了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we get that stereo fixed we can put up a sign, close up shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我觉得还是算了  布鲁诺  -别这样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what, I don't think so, Bruno. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-怎么  你戒酒了  -不是  我就是不...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why, you quit drinking? - No, I just don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么着  下周六我们再一起戒酒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell you what, we can both quit next Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳  洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine. Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.84,0:20:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-洛琳  -爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lorraine. - Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  谢天谢地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.71,0:21:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你得联系格拉策尔家  -她刚打来了  没事了...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have to call the Glatzels. - She just called, you're fine--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得警告他们  那个孩子被它附身了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to warn them, it's got the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  没事了  结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's fine, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维安全了  恶魔已经消散了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David is safe, the demon is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿尔尼  阿尔尼被附身了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne. It's got Arne!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害  干得漂亮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful, man. Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.52,0:21:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  别让我一个人喝闷酒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man, don't make me drink alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.61,0:21:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你女朋友会觉得我是个酒鬼的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your girl's gonna think I'm a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在悉尼看过这些人的演唱会吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I saw these guys play in Sydney?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们差点没把女王剧院的顶给掀翻{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They nearly blew the roof off Her Majesty's Theater!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁诺  能把声音关小点吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruno! Can you turn that down?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在测试他修得怎么样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm testing out his work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  你没事吧  布鲁诺{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Are you okay? Bruno--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-来跳舞  兄弟  -布鲁诺  不  别闹了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's dance, brother! - Bruno! No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁诺  布鲁诺  我的天呐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruno. Bruno! Oh, my Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  布鲁诺  睡觉觉吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Bruno, go night-night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  先跳舞  -不跳了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! Not until we dance. - Yes! No, we're not dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-就跳一支  一支  -我不想跳舞  布鲁诺{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One dance! One dance! - I don't want to dance! Bruno!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  就一支舞{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, one dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.05,0:23:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我是托马斯警官  -我叫洛琳·沃伦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Officer Thomas. - My name is Lorraine Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.47,0:23:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这么说你会觉得我疯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how this is going to sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.84,0:23:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在布鲁克菲尔德寄养犬舍{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there's going to be a tragedy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.68,0:23:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即将发生一起惨案{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the Brookfield Boarding Kennels.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黛比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Debbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-阿尔尼  -布鲁诺{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Arne... - Bruno?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.44,0:23:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁诺  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruno, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  救救我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne. What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是干什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.81,0:23:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, please stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.58,0:23:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.59,0:24:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.09,0:24:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.09,0:25:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在原地别动  好吗  不要动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you just stay right there, okay? Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.09,0:25:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能伤了人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I hurt someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是托马斯警司{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Sergeant Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.16,0:25:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现一名受害者倒地  有多处捅伤{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have one victim down, multiple stab wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日下午  布鲁诺·索尔斯在光天化日之下被谋杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Residents of Brookfield were shocked this afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁克菲尔德市民惊恐万分{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the broad daylight murder of Bruno Sauls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.25,0:25:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索尔斯是当地一家犬舍的经理{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sauls, the manager of a local dog kennel,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.35,0:25:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被捅了二十二刀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was stabbed 22 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.39,0:25:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该市建市193年来首次发生谋杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the first murder in that town's 193-year history.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁能登耶和华的山{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who shall ascend into the hill of the Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.19,0:25:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁能站在祂的圣所{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or who shall stand in his holy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.89,0:25:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是手洁心清{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He that hath clean hands, and a pure heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:57.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不向虚妄{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who hath not lifted up his soul unto vanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.64,0:25:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起誓不怀诡诈的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor sworn deceitfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他必蒙耶和华赐福{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shall receive the blessing from the Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.63,0:26:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又蒙救他的神使他成义{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and righteousness from the God of his salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.80,0:26:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  可以了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.76,0:26:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些宗教物品本来足以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These religious objects would've been enough
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.48,0:26:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,激怒一个恶灵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to provoke an inhuman spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果它确实存在的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if there was one present.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.53,0:26:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不是说明他没有被附身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean he's not possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.87,0:26:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能诵读圣经可以证明这点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact that he can read from the Bible just seals it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这是什么意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what does this mean, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是疯了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:39.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在没有被附身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well... you're not possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.55,0:26:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不代表你之前没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that doesn't mean that you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.01,0:26:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我主动叫恶魔进入我体内{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... invited this thing into me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.80,0:26:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他死去的原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that's the reason that he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  无论我受到什么惩罚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you know, whatever happens to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.52,0:26:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我自找的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.27,0:26:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.77,0:27:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.82,0:27:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我也在场{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.65,0:27:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever is going on...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.57,0:27:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管那天发生了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever happened that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.62,0:27:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不是阿尔尼干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was not Arne.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会竭尽所能帮你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to help you in every way that we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.76,0:27:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果恶魔已经离开  你们现在还能做什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the demon's gone, what can you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.56,0:27:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的律师是谁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's your lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.89,0:27:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被发现时  全身沾满了受害者的血{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was found covered in the victim's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.06,0:27:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶器也是他的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The murder weapon belongs to him
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.44,0:27:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面沾满他的指纹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's got his fingerprints all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.69,0:27:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人质疑这些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's disputing any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼知道他要进监狱了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne knows that he's going to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.82,0:27:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是说有可以减轻处罚的情节{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we're saying is that there were mitigating circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.86,0:27:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以减轻处罚的情节{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitigating circumstances?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.78,0:27:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也觉得他不该被判处死刑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't think he should get the death sentence, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.70,0:27:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不会在陪审团前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I am not going before a grand jury
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.83,0:27:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说他是被恶魔附身了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and saying he was possessed by demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.33,0:27:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有这样的先例{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.12,0:28:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有过的  英格兰有过两起这样的案例{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes it has! It's been done twice in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.63,0:28:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克尔·泰勒案就是几年前的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Michael Taylor case was just a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.71,0:28:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我换个措辞  之前从未有过这样申辩成功的案例{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me rephrase that. It's never been done successfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.26,0:28:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让我们帮助你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.38,0:28:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德和我已经{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed and I have proven the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.68,0:28:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无数次证明过恶魔的存在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}existence of the demonic hundreds of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.10,0:28:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是对教会  这是法庭{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've proven it to the church. This is a court of law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证据的标准完全不同{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The standards of evidence are completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证人每次上庭前都要向上帝发誓所述为实{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The courts accepts the existence of God
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.52,0:28:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以法庭是承认上帝的存在的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every time a witness swears to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.56,0:28:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想现在是时候让他们承认恶魔也存在了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's about time they accept the existence of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.65,0:28:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们连我都说服不了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you going to convince a jury
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.66,0:28:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说服陪审团{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you can't even convince me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.33,0:28:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样  你来我们家吃晚餐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what. You come over to our house for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.42,0:28:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看我们这些年收集的证据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll show you the evidence we've collected over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.71,0:28:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们介绍你认识安娜贝尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Introduce you to Annabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.50,0:28:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那样你还不相信  我们就不再插手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're not convinced, we'll butt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.93,0:28:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  有什么都拿出来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Show me what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.72,0:28:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰逊先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Johnson,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.72,0:29:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,案件编号SAJ1216{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to count one of indictment number S-A-J-1-2-1-6,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.98,0:29:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起诉你犯有一级谋杀罪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which charges you with first-degree murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.02,0:29:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A级重罪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a class-A felony,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.61,0:29:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认罪吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how do you plead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.61,0:29:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官阁下  我的委托人不认罪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Honor, my client pleads not guilty
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.20,0:29:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抗辩理由是恶魔附身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by reason of demonic possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.80,0:29:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太胡闹了  我自己能下楼梯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is ridiculous. I can walk down a flight of stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.76,0:29:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了  你都不应该下床{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hush. You shouldn't even be out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.06,0:29:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚跟地检办公室的一个朋友谈了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just talked to a friend of mine in the prosecutor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会主张判死刑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna go for the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.23,0:29:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会进行辩护  但那个孩子是生是死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll build the case, but that kid is gonna either live or die
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.11,0:29:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取决于你们两个能发现什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depending on what you two find.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.45,0:29:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不会让他失望的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we won't let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.91,0:29:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望如此{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.58,0:30:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持联系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.79,0:30:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在怎么办{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.84,0:30:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们以前从不需要在附身发生后作出证明{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've never had to prove a possession after the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.96,0:30:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔不会就这样消失{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Demons don't just disappear like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么细节{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something else going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.18,0:30:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次被我们忽视了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something that we missed the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.31,0:30:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从哪开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.60,0:30:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从一开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.94,0:30:31.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是1981年7月18日{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's July 18th, 1981.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.53,0:30:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艾德·沃伦  在场的还有洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Ed Warren, here with Lorraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.40,0:30:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朱迪·格拉策尔  黛博拉·格拉策尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Judy Glatzel, Deborah Glatzel,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.07,0:30:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维·格拉策尔和阿尔尼·约翰逊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David Glatzel and Arne Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  开始吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.91,0:30:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维第一次出现这种行为时谁在场{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was there when David first started exhibiting this behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.46,0:30:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都在  那是我们搬进去那天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all were. It was the day we moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧  玩得开心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go. Go have fun with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.96,0:30:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(五个月前)
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.71,0:30:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-想订披萨吗  -好啊  我现在就订{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanna order some pizza? - Yeah sure, I'll do that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.18,0:30:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把那箱子放下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that box down a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:30:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-为什么  -我只是...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.80,0:30:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.01,0:31:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-看看...  -怎么了  阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have a look... - What is... Arne!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.93,0:31:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道结婚时才应该新娘抱吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you're supposed to do this when you get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.77,0:31:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  说不定我们也会结婚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so maybe we'll do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.69,0:31:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.09,0:31:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.50,0:33:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.73,0:33:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.77,0:33:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像一场梦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.77,0:33:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟别人说的时候  没人相信我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nobody believed me when I told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.24,0:34:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是我第一次看见它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was the first time I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.34,0:34:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.59,0:34:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会邀请了一个恶魔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could he have invited a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.75,0:34:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他才进来了几分钟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was only in here for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.09,0:34:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里什么东西都没有呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There wasn't even anything in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.59,0:34:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张水床本来放在哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was the water bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.43,0:34:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地毯的位置{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where that rug is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.68,0:34:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,床垫爆掉的时候把地板泡坏了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wood got damaged when the mattress ruptured.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.06,0:34:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我能看一下吗  -请便{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mind if I have a look? - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.25,0:34:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是水渍{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not water damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  能让我来吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon, will you let me handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.89,0:35:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你如果钻进去  会把裙子弄脏的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to ruin your dress if you go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.27,0:35:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客房在十五英尺处  右手边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, um, the guest room's about 15 feet in and to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.61,0:35:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-小心点  -拿着我的包{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just be careful. - Just hold my purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.32,0:36:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳  你没事吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.66,0:36:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事  艾德  一只老鼠而已{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine, Ed. It's just a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.69,0:38:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一个女巫图腾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a witch's totem,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.40,0:38:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是撒旦崇拜者在仪式中使用的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}used by Satanists in their rituals.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.07,0:38:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我跟你说过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember how I told you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.74,0:38:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶灵需要被邀请吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that an inhuman spirit needs to be invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.49,0:38:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时还想不通戴维怎么会做到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you couldn't imagine how David could do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.33,0:38:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是对的  不是他邀请的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you were right, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.59,0:38:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认为戴维被诅咒了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think David was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.67,0:38:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在驱魔那一晚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on the night of the exorcism,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.38,0:38:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诅咒从戴维传到了阿尔尼身上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the curse was passed from David into Arne.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.76,0:38:41.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诅咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.60,0:38:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说这是有人故意做的吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying someone did this to us... on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.35,0:38:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们听说过类似的撒旦仪式{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've heard of satanic rituals like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.31,0:38:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔被召唤出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The demon is summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.61,0:38:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被附身的个体夺走一条性命后  恶魔就会离开{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the possessed individual takes a life and the demon departs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.65,0:38:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以阿尔尼事后能诵读《圣经》{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why Arne was able to read from the Bible afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.74,0:39:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我们认为诅咒戴维的人就是用这个召唤出恶魔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. We think whoever cursed David, used this to draw the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们希望你们能向所有警局{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'd like you to start mailing these out
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.20,0:39:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄出这些照片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to every police department you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.29,0:39:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先从本地的开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.04,0:39:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄清楚他们有没有见过类似的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, just find out if they've ever seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.96,0:39:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们还能向一个人打听这事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There might be someone else we can ask about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.09,0:39:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们记得帮助揭露{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember the priest
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.22,0:39:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公羊门徒邪教的那个神父吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who helped expose the Disciples of the Ram cult?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.18,0:39:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是十到十二年前的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would've been about 10 or 12 years ago--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.18,0:39:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-卡斯特纳神父  -对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father Kastner? - Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.14,0:39:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过他不再是神父了  他退休一阵子了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only it isn't "Father" Anymore, he's been retired for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.85,0:39:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾试图帮助那些人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to help those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.15,0:39:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试图理解他们为什么那样做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to understand why they did what they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.65,0:39:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有谁能告诉我们这是什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anyone is going to be able to tell us what this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.86,0:39:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是他了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.89,0:40:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡斯特纳神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Kastner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.19,0:40:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没听见车开进来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't hear the car drive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:19.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有谁想吃个煎蛋饼吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would either of you care for an omelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.28,0:40:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出门前吃过早饭了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had breakfast before we left home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.20,0:40:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艾德·沃伦  这是我妻子洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Ed Warren, this is my wife Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.87,0:40:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手上沾了鸡屎{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have chicken shit on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.51,0:40:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.52,0:40:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了你们看过这个吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget you ever saw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.69,0:40:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前见过吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen it before?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.94,0:40:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  但我见过类似的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But I've seen ones like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.32,0:41:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个很复杂精妙  是非常邪恶的物件{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is sophisticated. It's a very nasty piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.32,0:41:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不理解的是为什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I don't understand is... is why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.87,0:41:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  那个被附身的小男孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, the little boy who was possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.66,0:41:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没做错什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.58,0:41:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会有人盯上这家人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would someone target this family?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.87,0:41:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.63,0:41:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因不重要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "why" is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.30,0:41:22.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原因与这个撒旦崇拜者的一切理念相悖{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The "Why" is counter to everything that the Satanist stands for.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.09,0:41:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的目标只有混乱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His sole aim is chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.64,0:41:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝望是他的佳酿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His nectar is despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.68,0:41:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但肯定有人把它放到了他们房子底下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But someone had to put it under their house.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.14,0:41:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能从这个图腾看出幕后黑手的什么特征{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what does this tell you about the person who made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.90,0:41:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.38,0:42:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想下去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.97,0:42:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.01,0:42:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们来此的原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the reason you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.61,0:42:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在研究公羊门徒的时候收集了这些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I collected these while I was studying the Disciples of the Ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你应该把这些都烧了  -我想过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You should burn all this. - I've thought of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.97,0:42:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得把它们锁起来更安全{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I felt it was safer to keep them locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.93,0:42:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢亲自消除这些威胁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like taking guns off the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.98,0:42:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你不是用杜威十进制分类法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you have all these books organized
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.94,0:43:02.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整理这些书的吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}using the Dewey Decimal System, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.57,0:43:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. No, I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.82,0:43:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们寻找的线索可能在任何地方  或者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clues you seek could be anywhere. Or, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.74,0:43:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不在这儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or, they may not be here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.95,0:43:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我研究这些人九年了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I studied these people for nine years.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.00,0:43:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们用血祭崇拜撒旦和它的恶魔们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They worshipped Satan and his demons with blood sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.67,0:43:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用丑恶的仪式玷污圣地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They defiled holy land with their obscene rituals,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.47,0:43:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且犯下了亵渎上帝的罪行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they committed acts of blasphemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.22,0:43:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我永远也不会提起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I shall never speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.39,0:43:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这些行为给了他们力量{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... these acts gave them power.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.77,0:43:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对门徒们的审判{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trial of the Disciples,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.57,0:43:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时的首席检察官  他的妻子怀孕了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the lead prosecutor, his wife was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.41,0:43:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门徒们全部被判有罪  几天后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few days after the Disciples were all found guilty,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.74,0:43:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的孩子早产了六个礼拜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his baby was born six weeks early,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.54,0:43:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏长在了身体外{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with its heart outside of its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.92,0:44:04.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个月后  他的妻子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three months later, his wife committed suicide
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.13,0:44:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躺在铁轨上自杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by laying her neck on a railroad track.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.42,0:44:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个高阶撒旦崇拜者绝不是可以轻视的对手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A master Satanist is not an adversary to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.35,0:44:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道有什么样的危险  比你想的更清楚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know the dangers, better than you might think.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.27,0:44:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就要被判死刑的男孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This boy, who's headed to the death chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.69,0:44:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值得你们不惜一切代价去拯救吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is saving him worth everything you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.66,0:44:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们很可能会失去所有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that's what it may very well cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.39,0:45:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要不要清理干净{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you gonna clean it up, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.23,0:45:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.97,0:46:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.28,0:46:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 为我涂上你的颜色  亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Color me your color, darling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.28,0:46:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道你是谁 ∮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I know who you are ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.21,0:46:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 洗去你的颜色  孩子 ∮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Come up off your color, child ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.71,0:46:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道你从哪来 ∮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I know where you're coming ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.51,0:46:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道你是谁 ∮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I know who you are ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.77,0:47:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它刚才在这  我发誓  它刚才在这{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was here! I swear to God, it was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.22,0:47:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(沃伦)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.92,0:47:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看佩伦一家送了什么来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look what the Perron family sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.76,0:47:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还真贴心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that was sweet of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.55,0:47:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我去接  -艾德  我来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got it. - Ed, let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.85,0:47:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  没关系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.89,0:47:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-喂  -艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.10,0:47:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有线索了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.39,0:47:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚跟丹佛市的一位凶杀案警探通过电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got off the phone with a homicide detective in Danvers,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.19,0:47:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想跟你们谈谈  他说他见过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he wants to talk to you guys. He says he says he's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.57,0:47:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(马萨诸塞州  丹佛市)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.24,0:48:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(寻人启事  杰西卡·露易丝·斯特朗)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.96,0:48:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂·林肯和杰西卡·斯特朗四个月前失踪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katie Lincoln and Jessica Strong went missing about four months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.04,0:48:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们在高中是最好的朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were best friends in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.67,0:48:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂的尸体在这附近被找到  被捅了二十二刀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katie's body was found near here, stabbed 22 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.18,0:48:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们至今没找到杰西卡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still haven't found Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.64,0:48:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但当我们在五月搜查她的家时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when we searched her home back in May...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.39,0:48:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现了这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.52,0:48:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是专家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.61,0:48:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于这个你们能告诉我什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can you tell me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说  很有限{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to be honest, not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.90,0:48:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能说  如果这个图腾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only that if this totem
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.49,0:48:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟布鲁克菲尔德的那个原理一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}works the same way as the one in Brookfield,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.41,0:48:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那失踪的女孩有可能是被附身了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's possible that your missing girl was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.04,0:48:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我读过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I've read all about
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.96,0:48:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们对于布鲁克菲尔德发生的事的看法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you two think happened in Brookfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.75,0:48:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我只在乎基于现实的线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm only interested in leads that are grounded in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.80,0:48:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  我们也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. So are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.96,0:48:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们希望{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were actually hoping
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.76,0:49:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这案件资料里的内容{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there might be something in this case file
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.34,0:49:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能帮助证明阿尔尼的情况{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might help prove Arne's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.09,0:49:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不  我叫你们来是为了帮我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. I brought you here to help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.39,0:49:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是反过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.39,0:49:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我们找到了那个东西之后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we've been looking for a link to some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.89,0:49:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一直在寻找与某种邪教的联系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}satanic cult ever since we found that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.39,0:49:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些恶魔崇拜者  他们只是人类{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these devil-worshippers, they're just people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.77,0:49:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实疯狂且邪恶  但只是人罢了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy, evil people, but, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.94,0:49:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们能够互相帮助{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.66,0:49:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要看你们的案件资料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to see your casefile...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.91,0:49:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你需要找到那个失踪的女孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you need to find the missing girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.20,0:49:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  给我们个机会吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, give us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.16,0:49:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-给你们机会做什么  -找到杰西卡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To do what exactly? - To find Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.00,0:49:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经在这片森林里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been combing through these forests
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.33,0:49:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜查三个多月了  沃伦太太{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for over three months now, Mrs. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.92,0:49:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能看到你们看不到的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see things that your people can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.57,0:49:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一把刀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of these
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.36,0:50:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是杀害凯蒂·林肯的凶器{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the knife used on Katie Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外两把是我从证物柜里随便拿的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The others I just pulled from the evidence locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.45,0:50:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  你想让她选出哪一把是凶器吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what? You want her to pick out the murder weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.04,0:50:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会带你们去案发现场{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.83,0:50:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我要先看看她的能力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but first I want to see what she can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.42,0:50:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.42,0:50:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妻子的天赋可不是什么助兴节目{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife's gift is not a sideshow attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.00,0:50:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果她真像你说的那么神{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she is what you say she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.21,0:50:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这对她来说就是小事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then this shouldn't be a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.30,0:50:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不对  沃伦先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Warren. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.17,0:50:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不行  别想了  我们...  -是这一把{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way! Forget it. We-- - It's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.77,0:50:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过就是三分之一的概率罢了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a one-in-three chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.03,0:50:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这首歌挺合适的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This song's appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.15,0:50:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.49,0:50:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我其实见过猫王一次{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I actually met Elvis once.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.91,0:50:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.66,0:50:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是在他生前还是死后  -生前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Was that before or after he died? - Before...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.16,0:50:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死后也见过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and after.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.72,0:51:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘记转弯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.85,0:51:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们找到凯蒂尸体的地方是在刚才那边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spot where you found Katie's body, it was back that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.69,0:51:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们现在在丹佛市{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in Danvers, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.82,0:51:25.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们能找到办法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they can find some way to
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.74,0:51:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那里的案子和你的经历联系起来  那么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}connect what happened there to what happened to you, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.07,0:51:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能找到规律{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's... it's a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.83,0:51:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们甚至有可能找到罪魁祸首{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They might even find out who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.04,0:51:38.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  听上去真棒  是吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Well, that sounds great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.21,0:51:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-真棒  -亲爱的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's great. - Baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.50,0:51:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.92,0:51:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.80,0:51:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好  就是累了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine, I'm tired, you know--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.18,0:51:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.51,0:51:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有事情瞒着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're keeping something from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.27,0:51:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我看不出来吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think I can tell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.52,0:52:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好  特别好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm fine. Totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.45,0:52:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里面好冷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.07,0:52:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.20,0:52:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像他们想要冻死我们似的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like, they're trying to freeze us out, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.96,0:52:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得那种感觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember what it felt like.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.54,0:52:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是觉得冷  而且总有东西在跟着你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always cold, and you're never alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.97,0:52:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  你在说什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.30,0:52:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你无法入睡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.68,0:52:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你的脑中总是不能安静下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's never quiet in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.10,0:52:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候你会思考一些事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you think something,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.68,0:52:40.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你又不确定那是不是你自己的想法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you're not sure if it was really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.23,0:52:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在你能看到它了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now you're seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.61,0:52:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它总是在你左右  叫你去做一些事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's here with you. And it's telling you to do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.53,0:52:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  它让你做什么事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, what is it telling you to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.37,0:53:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定要这样拄着拐杖在森林里走吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you should be tromping through the woods like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.02,0:53:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.77,0:53:12.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你在担心什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what are you worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.83,0:53:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是担心她做不到吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid she won't be able to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.43,0:53:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.75,0:53:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是担心她会成功{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that she will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.88,0:53:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  这里发生过可怕的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, something terrible happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.82,0:55:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂  等等我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katie, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.48,0:55:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有东西要送给你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.30,0:55:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在今年的五月节上卖这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were selling them at the May Festival this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.65,0:55:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父母还拉你去五月节呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents still dragging you up there for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.51,0:55:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从我六岁开始  每年都去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every year, since I was six.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.21,0:55:26.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里挺蠢的  但是我觉得这个很酷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dumb, but, I thought this was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.36,0:55:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我想起我们高中时一起编的那些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It reminded me of the ones we made in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.48,0:55:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你帮我戴上好吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you help me put it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.06,0:55:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.35,0:56:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.00,0:56:35.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  停下吧  够了  拜托{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon, that's enough. That's enough! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.76,0:56:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂  凯蒂  我的天啊  我干了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katie? Katie? Oh, my God. What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.97,0:56:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.34,0:57:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.47,0:57:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.85,0:57:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.38,0:57:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.45,0:58:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  我抓住你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I got you. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在下面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.27,0:58:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  她在悬崖下面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, she's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.33,0:58:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血压有点高{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood pressure's a little high.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.25,0:58:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你一片血管舒张药{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna give you a vasodilator.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.09,0:58:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要把这药片含在舌头下面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pill, you're gonna put it under your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.46,0:58:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够帮助扩张你的血管{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll open up your blood vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.22,0:58:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  我有这种药{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I have those.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.09,0:58:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落在家里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left them at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.29,0:58:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我要是你的话下次肯定长记性{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I wouldn't do that anymore if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.50,0:58:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让我们单独谈一谈吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind giving us a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.86,0:58:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜救队找到了一具尸体{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recovery team found a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.80,0:58:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是不是...  -还不确定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it-- - We're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.62,0:58:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道看上去可能性很大{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.02,0:59:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是在验尸官验明尸体身份之前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, I don't want any of this
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.18,0:59:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不希望关于此案的任何消息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}getting out until we have a positive ID
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.91,0:59:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被公之于众{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the coroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.72,0:59:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这片水域搜寻过两次{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we dragged this basin. Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.79,0:59:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要搜寻第三次真的挺困难的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to pull teeth to get it done a third time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.88,0:59:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是你们帮忙  我们根本做不到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never would've done it if it weren't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.05,0:59:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴我们能帮上忙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just glad we could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.75,0:59:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你们的住处{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me know where you're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.74,0:59:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明早我会把案件资料给你们送去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll get that casefile to you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.78,0:59:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(布鲁尼奥旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.26,0:59:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.20,0:59:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天  我打了一天的电话都没人接{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, I've been leaving messages all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.47,0:59:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-出什么事了  -是阿尔尼  它跟上他了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong? - It's Arne. It followed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.08,0:59:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说过一切都结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said this was over,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.05,0:59:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在他和那个东西被困在里面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now he's trapped in there with this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它正在教唆他自杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's telling him to kill himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.36,0:59:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黛比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.32,0:59:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静下来听我说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just calm down and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.63,0:59:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你给监狱的牧师打电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to call the prison chaplain, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.80,0:59:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-纽曼神父  -对  纽曼神父  告诉他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father Newman. - Father Newman. Tell him that
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.76,0:59:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼需要接受全天候自杀监视  他有...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne needs to be put on a 24-hour suicide watch! He's got--
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.27,0:59:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  听得见吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.74,1:00:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.78,1:00:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.09,1:00:46.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝给予每个人保护自己的权利{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God gives everyone the right to defend themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.30,1:01:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个恶魔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This demon...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.61,1:01:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是它自己想来的  它是被召唤来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not here of its own free will. It was summoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.30,1:01:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话并不能让我好受些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doesn't make me feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.92,1:01:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这意味着  我们知道这是个诅咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means, we know that this is a curse,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.54,1:01:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而诅咒是可以被打破的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and curses can be broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.47,1:01:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  那我们怎么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Then, how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.74,1:01:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在格拉策尔家时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back at the Glatzel house,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.63,1:01:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我碰到了戴维的手  看到了一些画面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I touched David's hand and I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.55,1:01:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我不知道那是什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what it was then.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.12,1:01:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在我认为{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think that I was connected
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.34,1:01:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是和罪魁祸首连接到了一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the person who is responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.32,1:01:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  他们找到的那具尸体{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, that body they found...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.13,1:01:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那真的是杰西卡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it's Jessica, if it's really her,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.38,1:01:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么这个连接应该可以被再次打开{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then that connection could still be open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.86,1:02:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定还有别的方法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gotta be another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.53,1:02:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay... okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.03,1:02:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.54,1:03:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华是我的牧者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord is my shepherd,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.05,1:03:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必不至缺乏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is nothing I shall want.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.15,1:03:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他使我躺卧在青草地上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He maketh me to lie down in green pastures...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(帕尔默里殡仪馆)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.60,1:03:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面没人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.88,1:03:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留张纸条就行了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll leave a note.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.20,1:04:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.15,1:05:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(丹佛市警察局  无名氏)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.87,1:05:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你千万小心点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.83,1:05:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到什么了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.39,1:06:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  什么也没看见{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.66,1:06:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里什么也没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.38,1:06:10.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我感知不到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sensing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.80,1:06:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-洛琳  怎么了  -是连接{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lorraine, what is it? - The connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.04,1:06:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连接在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.89,1:07:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到什么了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.11,1:07:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.66,1:07:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了一些台阶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, there are... some stairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.05,1:07:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到火车的声音{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.37,1:07:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.31,1:07:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了祭坛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's an altar.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.77,1:07:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多黑色的蜡烛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those black candles.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.15,1:07:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十二支蜡烛摆成了一个圈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's 12 of them. In a circle.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.65,1:08:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.42,1:08:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  够了  回来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's enough, come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.39,1:08:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.27,1:08:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.75,1:08:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个女人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.14,1:08:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看到她的长相吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you see her?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.23,1:08:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此刻我就是她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.50,1:08:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能看出她在哪里吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you tell where she is?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.38,1:08:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  我...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.48,1:08:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她又开始了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在连接阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's reaching out to Arne.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.67,1:08:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她想要完成这个诅咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's trying to complete the curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.49,1:08:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她控制住他了  她控制了阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she has him. She has Arne.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.51,1:08:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.13,1:09:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.48,1:09:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终止这黑色安息日{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End this black sabbath.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.82,1:09:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以受难耶稣之血命令你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the blood of Calvary I command it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.56,1:09:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有犯人割腕了  C19房{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a cutter! C-19!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.30,1:09:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作点  孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.77,1:09:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.40,1:09:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝令我看见你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God has shown you to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.58,1:09:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的上帝诅咒了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then your God has damned you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.21,1:09:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  这个连接是双向的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed. The connection works both ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.11,1:10:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.11,1:10:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得醒过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.28,1:10:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorr...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.38,1:11:04.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.51,1:11:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得断开连接{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to break the connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.88,1:11:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开她的手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop her hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.88,1:11:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳  放开她的手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine, let go of her hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.06,1:11:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.32,1:11:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她知道我们是谁了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows who we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.89,1:11:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(沃伦)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.79,1:11:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.57,1:11:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.92,1:11:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼怎么样了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's Arne?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.02,1:11:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会没事的  他们给他打了镇定剂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be all right. They got him sedated.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.14,1:12:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拿到案件资料了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got the casefile.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.45,1:12:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里面一定能找到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's got to be something here
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.45,1:12:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那两个女孩和阿尔尼的联系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that connects these girls back to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.10,1:12:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.53,1:12:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有东西要给你们看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got something to show you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.71,1:12:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在意大利巫术书里找到这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it in the Stregheria.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.41,1:12:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在文艺复兴早期{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's early Renaissance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.98,1:12:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教会利用它来识别并迫害巫术{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Church used it to identify and persecute witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.87,1:12:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拉丁语有点生疏了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now... my Latin is rusty,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.35,1:12:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得这段{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but... I think this...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.70,1:12:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲的是活人祭祀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is talking about a human sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.06,1:12:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个被杀  一个自杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One by murder and the other by suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.85,1:12:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,书里有说怎么停止这个仪式吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it say how to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.93,1:12:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有  好像...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it looks like...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.34,1:12:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以通过摧毁施咒祭坛来打破诅咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can break the curse by destroying the altar it was cast from.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.91,1:12:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.61,1:12:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段好像是用阿拉米语写的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this part looks like Aramaic.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.20,1:12:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面这段我看不懂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This next part, I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.25,1:12:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你打断她了  说不定她会放弃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you stopped her. Maybe she'll give up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.26,1:12:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不能放弃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.72,1:12:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦开始  诅咒就必须完成{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once started, the curse must be completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.37,1:13:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她赌上了她的灵魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her soul depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.93,1:13:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会找到别的办法的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.16,1:13:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到的幻象里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there anything in your vision
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.41,1:13:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么线索能帮我们找到她的祭坛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might help us find her altar?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.97,1:13:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里很冷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.05,1:13:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天花板上有水滴下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was water dripping from the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.59,1:13:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像听到了火车声{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I heard a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.16,1:13:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但声音听起来很奇怪  就像{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it sounded strange somehow. Like, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.31,1:13:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不好  模糊不清{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, muffled?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.42,1:13:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能那地方在地下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe it was underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.95,1:13:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能  不知道是哪里的地下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be. I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.40,1:13:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个女人盯上戴维和杰西卡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This woman targeted David and Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.69,1:13:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他们两人有什么联系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe there's a connection there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.72,1:13:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take a look at the...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.65,1:13:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at the...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.43,1:13:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at the...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.16,1:13:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,案件资料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}file.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.73,1:14:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.37,1:15:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.93,1:15:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.42,1:15:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.27,1:16:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的收藏还挺有趣的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the two of you have gathered quite the collection.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.12,1:16:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是伤害她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you hurt her...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.83,1:16:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  沃伦先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't worry, Mr. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.31,1:16:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非常接近了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so close.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.96,1:16:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在放弃就太可惜了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hate for you to give up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.93,1:16:56.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命海水来浇到地上的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He who calls forth the water of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.36,1:16:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶和华是祂的名{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord of Hosts is His name!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.74,1:17:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解救你的仆人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deliver Thy servant
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.71,1:17:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脱离污灵的控制{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from all the workings of unclean spirits!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐惧吧  逃走吧  污灵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear and flee, unclean spirit!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.54,1:17:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.88,1:17:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.80,1:17:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.84,1:17:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  是她干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, it was her!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.86,1:17:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.62,1:17:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-艾德  到底怎么回事  -帮我找到它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ed, what the hell is going on? - Help me find it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.23,1:17:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.68,1:17:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.59,1:17:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.55,1:17:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.85,1:17:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她来过这里  她来过我们家里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was here! She was in our house!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.97,1:18:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些花是什么时候送来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did these get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.42,1:18:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天才送来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just arrived yesterday
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.70,1:18:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们当时在回家路上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you guys were driving home.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.64,1:18:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送到的时候都还很新鲜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were fresh when they got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.07,1:19:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得找到这个女人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find this woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.47,1:19:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经确认了这是诅咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've identified the curse
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.66,1:19:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在手里又有杰西卡的案件资料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now we have Jessica's casefile.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.34,1:19:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面一定有什么线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be something in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.03,1:19:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带上书去找人翻译{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm gonna take the book to be translated.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.23,1:19:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,书里一定有指引我们找到祭坛的线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be a clue about where we can find the altar.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.14,1:19:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们能做什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.34,1:19:23.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该去陪着阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go be with Arne.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.24,1:19:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他今晚最需要你在身边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna need you tonight more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.88,1:19:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找纽曼神父帮忙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask Father Newman for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.99,1:19:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德鲁  我们研究那些案件资料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drew, you and me are gonna tear into those files.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.25,1:19:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要找出两起案子之间的联系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to find a link between these cases.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.79,1:19:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒旦崇拜者的力量在夜里最强大  所以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a Satanist's power is strongest at night. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.48,1:19:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但愿她在夜幕降临前不要有所行动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope she doesn't try anything before then.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.18,1:20:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经把镇定剂停了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've stopped his sedation.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.45,1:20:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很快就会清醒过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be coming around soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.02,1:20:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些笔录里什么线索都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing in these interviews.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.57,1:20:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她从大学回来后  朋友们几乎都没见过她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her friends barely saw her after she got back from college.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.84,1:20:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得奇怪吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't that seem strange to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.62,1:20:30.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we're here,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.63,1:20:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格拉策尔家在这里  只有十五分钟车距{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Glatzels live here, just 15 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.94,1:20:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但杰西卡住在180英里之外{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Jessica lived 180 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.47,1:20:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么她在那么远的地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this one so far away?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.01,1:20:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西卡在哪里发现图腾的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where did Jessica find her totem?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.50,1:20:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚看到过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw something about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.09,1:20:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在对她父母的询问笔录里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in an interview with her parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.70,1:20:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在一个盒子里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in a box.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.85,1:20:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"她把图腾装在一个盒子里  从大学带回家"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"She brought it back home in a box from college."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.61,1:20:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里上的大学{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd she go to college?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.60,1:21:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费尔菲尔德市{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fairfield.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.78,1:21:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个女人就住在这一带{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This woman lives in the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.90,1:21:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜寻范围还是很大{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still a lot of ground to cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.27,1:21:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  但这里火车轨道并不多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but not a lot of train tracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.02,1:21:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得洛琳看到的幻象吗  她说听到火车声{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember Lorraine's vision? She said she heard a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.59,1:21:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时是几点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.23,1:21:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我们可以排除一些线路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can start eliminating some of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.92,1:21:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是临近午夜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably close to midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.79,1:21:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就不可能是这两条线路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it can't be either of these two.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.49,1:21:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通勤线路不会开到那么晚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The commuter lines don't run that late.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就只剩这条货运线了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That just leaves this freight line
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跨河的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that crosses the river here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.99,1:21:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,河{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The river.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.41,1:21:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.68,1:21:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沃伦太太{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Warren.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.52,1:21:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉  神父  我们打过电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Father, we tried calling,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.05,1:22:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是没人接{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we couldn't reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.87,1:22:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想请你帮忙翻译一段书里的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were hoping you'd help us translate a passage from this book.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.90,1:22:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以  请进{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.55,1:22:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.49,1:22:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车钥匙给我  你留在这里  报警{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your keys. You stay here, call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.27,1:22:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么跟他们说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to tell them?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便说什么  能让他们出警就行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything, just get 'em out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.89,1:22:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是讲诅咒的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.40,1:22:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,书上说  需要三个受害者才能完成诅咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says, the curse needs three victims to be complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.93,1:22:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,书里把他们称为{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It refers to them as...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.67,1:22:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"孩子  爱人和圣徒"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The child, the lover and the man of God."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.57,1:22:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是上帝之作的化身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The embodiment of God's work.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.67,1:22:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纯洁  爱  信仰{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purity, love, faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.98,1:23:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又发现新的受害者了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has there been another?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.87,1:23:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是艾德  我丈夫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Ed. It's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.50,1:23:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚我们在他办公室里发现了一个图腾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last night we found a totem in his office.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.53,1:23:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不幸了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.63,1:23:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  跟我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.59,1:23:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I need to show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.44,1:23:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.40,1:25:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里住了很多年了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been here many years...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.38,1:25:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从还是牧师的时候开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}starting when I was a priest.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.96,1:25:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教堂把这座磨坊当作储藏室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The church used this mill for storage.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.87,1:25:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用来存放那些他们惧怕的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's where they put the things that they were afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.73,1:25:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不理解的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things they didn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.31,1:25:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(伊思拉  三个月  1932年)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.05,1:25:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有过一个孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had a child?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.64,1:25:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她母亲死于难产{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her mother died in childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.97,1:25:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能让教会知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Church couldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.80,1:25:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我偷偷地把她养在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I raised her here, in secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.77,1:25:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们两个相依为命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.42,1:25:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(1952年  八月)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.12,1:26:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整间屋子都洋溢着幸福{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our happiness filled this house.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.01,1:26:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我继续研究这些神秘学{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I continued my studies into the occult.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.72,1:26:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来想要让她远离这些东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to protect her from all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.97,1:26:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但相反她却为此着迷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead I created a fascination.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.46,1:26:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.45,1:26:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定要小心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must be careful
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.69,1:26:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子会继承我们的痴迷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how our obsessions are passed to our children.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.59,1:26:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"住在至高者隐密处的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"He who dwells in the shelter of the most high
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.42,1:26:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必住在全能者的荫下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will rest in the shadow of the Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.91,1:26:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要论到耶和华说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will say of the Lord,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.16,1:26:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的避难所  是我的山寨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is my refuge and my fortress,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.68,1:26:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的神  是我所信靠的"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my God, in whom I trust."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.65,1:26:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,线路问题而已{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just the wiring.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.17,1:26:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂的  政府建筑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, state building.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.04,1:27:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黛比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.92,1:27:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.46,1:27:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.22,1:27:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她...她就在附近{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's... she's close.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.44,1:27:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早知道了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.62,1:27:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来向你求助  其实你从一开始就知道了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We came to you for help and you knew this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.57,1:27:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我的女儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.79,1:27:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无法...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.45,1:27:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想看透{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.94,1:27:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了这么多年{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all these years,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.85,1:27:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为她终于再回到我身边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought she'd come back to me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.82,1:28:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我知道她来这的真正原因了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I know the real reason she's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.04,1:28:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这片土地底下有隧道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are tunnels under this land.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.10,1:28:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她小时候经常在里面探索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She would explore them as a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.93,1:28:16.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的祭坛一定就在这下面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her altar must be down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.99,1:28:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是唯一能打破她诅咒的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only thing that can break her curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.83,1:28:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须摧毁祭坛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.76,1:28:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.41,1:28:46.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.71,1:29:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个失职的牧师{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I failed as a priest.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.39,1:29:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是个失职的父亲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I failed as a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.26,1:29:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你  上帝  别让我也失败...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, God, don't let me fail--
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.03,1:31:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.89,1:31:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.58,1:31:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.61,1:31:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.88,1:31:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.87,1:32:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.03,1:32:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.14,1:32:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.93,1:32:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.99,1:32:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.07,1:33:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.24,1:33:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.53,1:33:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.32,1:33:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.30,1:33:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛  看着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eyes and look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.89,1:33:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快睁眼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.77,1:33:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.21,1:33:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.57,1:33:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.16,1:34:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛琳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.43,1:34:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.52,1:34:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.74,1:34:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.63,1:34:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-要发生了  -现在吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's happening. - Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.23,1:34:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.52,1:35:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.53,1:35:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  艾德  求你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Ed, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.69,1:35:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.74,1:35:35.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.09,1:35:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  求你  没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, please. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.64,1:35:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Father who art in heaven
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.92,1:35:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 愿人都尊你的名为圣  -不  阿尔尼  没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- hallowed be thy name... - No, Arne. It's okay! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.56,1:35:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你的国降临  愿你的旨意行在地上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thy kingdom come, thy will be done...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.36,1:35:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-如同行在天上  -阿尔尼  没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- on earth as it is in heaven. - Arne, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.02,1:35:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  艾德  我求你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop this! Ed, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.03,1:35:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你  想起我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm begging you, remember me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.22,1:35:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.25,1:36:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.38,1:36:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  求你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.90,1:36:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想起我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.98,1:36:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊  警卫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.96,1:36:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...不叫我们遇见试探{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And lead us not into temptation
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.70,1:36:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我们脱离凶恶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but deliver us from evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.45,1:36:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我因为国度...  -阿尔尼  没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For thine is the kingdom... - Arne, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.87,1:36:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,权柄  荣耀...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the power and the glory...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.51,1:36:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到永远  阿门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...now and forever, amen!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.76,1:36:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父  愿人都尊你的名为圣{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed by thy name,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.41,1:36:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你的国降临  愿你的旨意行在地上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thy kingdom come, thy will be done
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.59,1:36:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-如同行在天上  -不  阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- on earth as it is in heaven. - No, Arne!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.46,1:36:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  阿尔尼  你要干什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne? Arne, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.70,1:36:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.83,1:36:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么  纽曼神父  帮帮他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Father Newman, help him!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.72,1:36:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你  警卫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please... Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.96,1:37:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你  住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.69,1:37:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你帮帮他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please help him!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.54,1:37:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会这么做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.15,1:37:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是错的  你心里明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wrong and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.30,1:37:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽曼神父  不  不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Newman... No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.16,1:37:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.99,1:37:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神父  让他停下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Father, make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.07,1:37:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父  愿人都尊你的名为圣{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.04,1:37:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿你的国降临{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thy kingdom come...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.45,1:37:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不  阿尔尼  不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Arne, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.05,1:37:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  住手  求你住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne, stop, please! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.62,1:37:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么做  阿尔尼  我爱你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this, Arne, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.45,1:37:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.98,1:37:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不叫我们遇见试探{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And lead us not into temptation,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.05,1:37:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我们脱离凶恶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but deliver us from evil!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.68,1:38:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德  想起我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed... Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.84,1:38:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她想让你和我反目成仇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She tried to turn you against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.28,1:38:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她认为你我之间的爱是我们的弱点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, she thinks our love is our weakness.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.41,1:38:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但并非如此{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.44,1:38:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非如此{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.26,1:38:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱是我们的力量{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.90,1:38:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.09,1:39:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼  阿尔尼  你没事吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne? Arne, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.05,1:39:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.10,1:39:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.94,1:40:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的诅咒被打破了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your curse is broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.47,1:40:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你承诺了恶魔  会献上一个灵魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised a demon a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.01,1:40:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得到  它是不会回地狱的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it can't go back to hell without one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.90,1:40:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.18,1:40:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.03,1:40:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我都结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please say it's over...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.92,1:41:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  我...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon... I...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.61,1:41:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘带药了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot my pills.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.02,1:42:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.53,1:42:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arne?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.54,1:42:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一下  阿尔尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Arne!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.99,1:43:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.65,1:43:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请被告起立{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will the defendant please rise?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.63,1:43:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(1981年11月24日  阿尔尼·约翰逊被判过失杀人罪名成立)
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.87,1:44:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(阿尔尼服刑五年  他在狱中和黛比完婚)
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.30,1:44:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(他们至今仍是夫妻)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.71,1:45:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在回顾此事时  听着录音{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As we go back now, listen to the tapes
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.76,1:45:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.79,1:45:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犹如身处现场  听见他动手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as well as being there and hearing him do it,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.07,1:45:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会不断地质疑  那男孩体内的到底是什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would constantly challenge what was in that boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.43,1:45:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那对整个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that do
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.63,1:45:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-法律体系会有什么影响  -是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to the whole system of law... - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.95,1:45:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一个人可以在庭上辩称{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if a person can walk in and say,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.04,1:45:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"是恶魔逼我做的"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The devil made me do it"?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.68,1:45:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  我要把这个放在你身上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, I'm going to put this on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.28,1:45:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奉耶稣之名  耶稣驱逐你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of Jesus, Jesus repels you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.62,1:45:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离这个孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave this child alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.30,1:45:40.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你额头上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.13,1:45:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(1981年2月16日  阿尔尼·约翰逊谋杀案)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.13,1:45:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住  你并不强大  你很软弱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, remember, you are not strong, you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.73,1:45:46.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很软弱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.78,1:45:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶稣爱这男孩  这是祂的孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus loves this boy. This is... this is His child.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.14,1:45:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他清醒过来  扶他起来  想想办法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake him out of it. Prop him up. Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.84,1:45:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在摆脱不了  妈妈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't get out of it right now, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.72,1:45:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他辱骂我  你却什么也没做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well he called me names, you didn't do nothing now!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.94,1:45:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们一直以来在干什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you think we've been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.25,1:45:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以圣父  圣子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of the Father and the Son
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.37,1:46:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和圣灵的名义  阿门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Holy Spirit, amen!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.89,1:46:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(法官  陪审团和神秘学)
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.49,1:46:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得摁住他  他叫我这么做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta hold him down. He told me to.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.16,1:46:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他摁在地上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.07,1:46:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈在这里  妈妈在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy's here. Mommy's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.31,1:46:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快醒醒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.03,1:46:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来  我们走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get up. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.14,1:46:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去  从我儿子体内滚出去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out. Get out of my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.79,1:46:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从我儿子体内滚出去  快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my son. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.15,1:46:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撑住  儿子  滚出去  远离我儿子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, son. Come on. Get out. Get away from my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.20,1:46:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊  不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.29,1:46:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的母亲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.51,1:46:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你是...{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.05,1:46:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戴维  戴维  醒醒啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David. David. Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.70,1:46:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.25,1:46:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开这男孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the boy go.
